# Shared restic excludes. Distributed to omarchy, omarchy-laptop and minipc
# (minipc's copy lives at /root/.config/restic/excludes).
#
# Pattern rules: a bare name with no slash matches that basename at ANY depth.
# A pattern starting with / is an absolute filesystem path. `*` does not cross
# a directory separator. Spaces are literal, no quoting needed.
#
# Everything here must be genuinely regenerable. When in doubt, keep it: the
# cost of storing a spare gigabyte is far lower than discovering at restore
# time that something was not actually reproducible.

# --- build artifacts and dependency trees, at any depth ---
node_modules
target
__pycache__
.venv
.cache

# --- language and tool caches, all re-fetchable from upstream ---
